---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Services | Techno War Room"
  description="Six ways we support must-win pursuits: RFP response, proposal decks, security questionnaires, pricing and SOW, competitive positioning, and case studies."
>
  <header class="svc-hero">
    <span class="band-top" style="background:var(--red)"></span>
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> ⚡ Services</nav>
      <span class="kicker">The arsenal ⚡ Two tiers, six weapons</span>
      <h1>Six ways <span class="hollow-ink">we show up</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Tier 1 runs inside a live pursuit against a deadline. Tier 2 builds your position and proof between pursuits, so the next one starts further ahead.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-tag">Tier 1 / Pursuit support</span><h2>Inside the <span class="u">live deal</span></h2></div>
      <div class="bento">
        <div class="card c-red"><span class="band"></span><span class="idx">01</span>
          <h3><a href="/services/rfp-response/">RFP and RFI response</a></h3><p>Requirement extraction, compliance matrices, drafting, and submission readiness. The whole machine.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card c-cobalt"><span class="band"></span><span class="idx">02</span>
          <h3>Proposal deck building</h3><p>The narrative and the artefact, from executive summary to the version the committee reads alone. Page coming as the build proceeds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card c-green"><span class="band"></span><span class="idx">03</span>
          <h3>Security questionnaires and vendor assessments</h3><p>Answer banks, gap identification, evidence mapping. Assessment season, handled. Page coming as the build proceeds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card c-mustard"><span class="band"></span><span class="idx">04</span>
          <h3>Pricing and SOW construction</h3><p>Scope, commercial structure, assumptions, and change control that survive procurement. Page coming as the build proceeds.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-tag">Tier 2 / Positioning and proof</span><h2>Between <span class="ur">the deals</span></h2></div>
      <div class="bento">
        <div class="card tier2"><span class="tier-chip">Tier 2 ⚡ Positioning</span><span class="idx">05</span>
          <h3>Competitive analysis and positioning</h3><p>Incumbent mapping, battlecards, and win themes before the fight starts. Page coming as the build proceeds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card tier2"><span class="tier-chip">Tier 2 ⚡ Proof</span><span class="idx">06</span>
          <h3><a href="/services/case-study-development/">Case study and reference development</a></h3><p>The proof material every future pursuit will lean on.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="cta" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <span class="sticker cta-stk">No charge to talk</span>
        <h2>Got a live one?</h2>
        <p>If there is a deal on the table, we can tell you quickly whether we can help and what it would involve. Or write to hello@technowarroom.com.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@technowarroom.com">Book a call</a>
        <svg class="cta-brick" viewBox="-60 0 240 220" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#brickhero"></use></svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
